  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Rural Producers in Commerical Agriculture (EPIC) to increase economic opportunities for smallholder farmers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Empowering Rural Producers in Commerical Agriculture (EPIC) to increase economic opportunities for smallholder farmers is a component of Commercial Agriculture for Smallholders and Agribusiness reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;1,388,737. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Food assistance, Agricultural development, Disaster prevention and preparedness.</narrative>
  </description>
